  With the advent of the fall season in his sagely researches, Amalric 
discovered a fabulous invention called the Postage Stamp!  The following 
benefits are conferred by the Postage Stamp:
  The Postage Stamp helps establish and regulate communications in your 
Kingdom.  There's also a P.  R.  bonanza:  You get to put your portrait on 
