  The fall cooled into early winter.  Amalric discovered nothing in his 
sagely experiments.

  Thy humble servant,   Watson, Squire to Amalric


From: Odysseus
To: Uga-Buga Makumb

  Honored Sovereign, 

  With the advent of the spring season, I prepared to quench my thirst for 
glory.  Lallipugh enlisted enough men in the Dolphin Sea to create the 333rd 
