occupied by the Centaur.  What treasure may lie there is unknown.  
Wood-Elves say that the Centaur is a cross-breed, with the body of a man and 
the trunk and legs of a horse.  He is a good archer and is usually friendly.

  A host of warriors carried the banner of 
Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll into the Forest province of Kildare, 
